Given that in triangle ABC, the lengths of the sides opposite to angles A, B, and C are a, b, and c respectively, and b = 3, c = 1, and A = 2B.
(1) Find the value of a;
(2) Find the value of sin(A + $\frac{\pi}{4}$).

